# Project Cursor Instructions

Before writing or editing code in this repository, you must read and adhere to:
- `AGENTS.md` (root) - Master guidance and Skill Loading Policy.
- `.agents/skills/feature-delivery-workflow/SKILL.md` for new or materially
  changed customer-facing journeys. Code is gated by approved flow, required UI
  design, spec, and an adequate implementation plan under `docs/`.
- Database schema management follows Prisma conventions in `.agents/skills/db-conventions/SKILL.md`.
- TypeScript standards follow `.agents/skills/typescript/SKILL.md`.

Do NOT duplicate or copy skills into `.cursor/` or elsewhere. Consult skills on demand directly from `.agents/skills/` as specified in `AGENTS.md`.
